[I] Python interface to Graphviz graph drawing package

[T] A Python interface to the Graphviz graph layout and visualization package.
[T] With PyGraphviz you can create, edit, read, write, and draw graphs using
[T] Python to access the Graphviz graph data structure and layout algorithms.

[U] https://pygraphviz.github.io/

